A prefix and an infix top-level function cannot share the same name in a
module.

```catala
declaration <add>
  content integer
  depends on x content integer, y content integer
  equals
    x - y

declaration add
  content integer
  depends on x content integer, y content integer
  equals
    x + y

declaration scope T:
  output x content integer

scope T:
  definition x equals add of 6, 3
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope T
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  A prefix and an infix top-level function cannot share the same name add in a module: rename one of them.
│
│ Prefix declaration:
├─➤ tests/func/bad/same_name_infix_prefix.catala_en:11.13-16:
│    │
│ 11 │ declaration add
│    │             ‾‾‾
│
│ Infix declaration:
├─➤ tests/func/bad/same_name_infix_prefix.catala_en:5.14-17:
│   │
│ 5 │ declaration <add>
│   │              ‾‾‾
└─
#return code 123#
```
